[ Men exclaim ]
Ice is your friend.

00:07:19.400 --> 00:07:22.067
It'll help those muscles.

00:07:22.067 --> 00:07:23.434
Got you in the nads there.

00:07:23.434 --> 00:07:26.200
Way off.
Miss.

00:07:26.200 --> 00:07:27.567
Finds it!
Whoo!

00:07:27.567 --> 00:07:32.901
-Come on! That's
Taika Waititi right there.

00:07:32.901 --> 00:07:34.567
"Next Goal Wins."

00:07:34.567 --> 00:07:36.400
Uh, before you go, I thought --

00:07:36.400 --> 00:07:38.901
I thought maybe we could play a
game inspired by your new movie,

00:07:38.901 --> 00:07:41.267
